+J3 pytest: 33 passed, 0 skipped, 0 failed (OMP_NUM_THREADS=1; smt-isef-env python).
+model_v2 pytest: 151 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failed (OMP_NUM_THREADS=1 PYTHONPATH=feng/src; smt-isef-env python).
